      <p class="text-xs text-ink-light-muted dark:text-ink-dark-muted">Field Engineering to CoE</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="space-y-4 text-ink-light-secondary dark:text-ink-dark-secondary text-[1.05rem] leading-[1.8] max-w-prose">
      <p>
        A five-year progression from hands-on field commissioning to regional engineering leadership. I started in the field commissioning central inverters and battery storage across Latin America, personally delivering site acceptance testing for over 800 MW of PV and early BESS installations.
      </p>
      <p>
        That foundation evolved into leading the regional Field Service organization across North LATAM, supporting a fleet of more than 2.1 GW of operating solar assets and approximately 60 MWh of BESS. Later, I established the LATAM Center of Expertise (CoE), centralizing tier-3 investigations directly with HQ R&amp;D and building technical certification programs for engineers across the region.
      </p>

      <!-- Company Logo / Branding Badge -->
